WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Dependencies. Mark what a task is waiting on; it stays blocked until those are done.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: build after design.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Link what it waits on → The task shows Blocked → The blocker is done → The task can be finished

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.620
Under Blocked by, find the task this one waits on…

5
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:28.780
…and pick it.

6
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:34.320
The task is Blocked until the sitemap is done.

7
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:41.890
Finishing it early is refused.

8
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:47.890
“… is waiting on other tasks”: Finish or unlink its blockers first.

9
00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:52.390
Search to link blockers
